  "description": "The meme falsely claims that 'white people walked on all fours' before 'black people came and showed them how to stand up.' This is historically inaccurate and deliberately misleading. It implies that Black people 'civilized' white people, which is a racist inversion of history and ignores the complex, often violent, historical interactions between different racial groups.",
